<title>JAPAN: Japan end-October oil product stocks - MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan end-October oil product stocks - MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Trade Ministry on Friday issued the following data on oil product stockpiles held by refineries, distributors and importers as of end-October.</p>
<p>		(1,000kl)   (1,000 bbl) mth/mth%  yr/yr%</p>
<p>Gasoline	 1,906	 11,989    - 0.4    -12.2</p>
<p>Naphtha	  1,876	 11,800    + 6.4    +19.0</p>
<p>Jet Fuel	   844	  5,309    + 5.0    + 0.5</p>
<p>Kerosene	 4,952	 31,148    + 3.9    - 0.8</p>
<p>Gas Oil	  2,347	 14,763    -12.8    +14.5</p>
<p>Fuel Oil A     1,754	 11,033    - 2.7    - 2.7</p>
<p>Fuel Oil B	   6	     38    -14.3    -14.3</p>
<p>Fuel Oil C     2,200	 13,838    + 6.1    + 7.6</p>
<p>Total	   15,885	 99,917    + 0.4    + 2.6</p>
</text>
